                    {
                        "form_id": "f71a81b3-475a-476d-ac92-a22aac7da1c9",
                        "entry_id": "5db5191c-ffd9-35f0-be5f-aa7f69e1a596",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "вои́телях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2b02ae52-81f3-3aa7-8027-1a25199193e3",
                        "entry_id": "5db5191c-ffd9-35f0-be5f-aa7f69e1a596",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн., высок. воин, военачальник"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0606ab9-71a8-4881-ae7b-f5316a7d8b73",
                                "sense_id": "2b02ae52-81f3-3aa7-8027-1a25199193e3",
                                "text": "Зазвенели трубы бранные: воители воссели на коней своих, приняли копья от оруженосцев и устремились друг ко другу."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5113dbb5-4b6c-4311-bb8d-09e4a857fd59",
                                "sense_id": "2b02ae52-81f3-3aa7-8027-1a25199193e3",
                                "text": "Надо отдать справедливость воителям, чьи войска маршировали из Согдианы в Бактриану и обратно: своё ремесло истребления они совершали с величайшей тщательностью."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b47e4eb9-6aab-3bb0-af57-b72ce979c913",
                        "entry_id": "5db5191c-ffd9-35f0-be5f-aa7f69e1a596",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., разг. человек с воинственным характером; драчун, забияка"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1ac19ce7-a2b4-36b1-aa97-341b63a7be41",
                        "entry_id": "5db5191c-ffd9-35f0-be5f-aa7f69e1a596",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. тот, кто ведет непримиримую борьбу с кем-либо или с чем-либо, защищает права, интересы кого-либо; борец"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d2e920d-e076-41e8-b28b-c61313301851",
                                "sense_id": "1ac19ce7-a2b4-36b1-aa97-341b63a7be41",
                                "text": "Еще я разглядел воителя за русскую пшеницу и прочие зерновые и овощи, лицо которого настолько обуглилось агрострастями, что стало похожим на сильно пригоревшую печеную картофелину."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "144bc4de-9c36-4f85-8962-eb041c06a76e",
                        "source_entry_id": "5db5191c-ffd9-35f0-be5f-aa7f69e1a596",
                        "source_sense_description": "воин",
                        "target_lang_word": "warrior",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "warrior",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63cca0dd-1a30-3318-884e-9a86be96f547",
                                        "entry_id": "08a41d82-fbf5-30d7-b99d-dccffd9e3700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is actively engaged in battle, conflict or warfare; a soldier or combatant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee1d032e-5c09-43e9-85a9-7ecbb6d6148c",
                                                "sense_id": "63cca0dd-1a30-3318-884e-9a86be96f547",
                                                "text": "Orion hit a rabbit once; but though sore wounded it got to the bury, and, struggling in, the arrow caught the side of the hole and was drawn out.[…]. Ikey the blacksmith had forged us a spearhead after a sketch from a picture of a Greek warrior; and a rake-handle served as a shaft."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ba8db62-6ad4-45b6-9b1c-f8a010b926b9",
                                                "sense_id": "63cca0dd-1a30-3318-884e-9a86be96f547",
                                                "text": "[Link:] Gee, it sure is boring around here.\n [King Harkinian:] My boy, this peace is what all true warriors strive for."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "434aba44-e3e8-341b-99d0-8ffeb7a152d9",
                                        "entry_id": "08a41d82-fbf5-30d7-b99d-dccffd9e3700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is aggressively, courageously, or energetically involved in an activity, such as athletics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a85a3088-8a37-4c38-b0aa-b4f7bf6902b9",
                        "source_entry_id": "5db5191c-ffd9-35f0-be5f-aa7f69e1a596",
